        <mxCell id="ceHBMdHGofH0zuc_rEOh-60" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Identify and collect relevant data to enable effective I&amp;amp;T-related risk&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;identification, analysis and reporting.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Integrate the management of I&amp;amp;T-related enterprise risk with overall enterprise risk management (ERM) and balance the costs and benefits of&amp;nbsp;managing I&amp;amp;T-related enterprise risk.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want the agile project team to enable the collection of relevant data, in order to enable effective risk identification, analysis and reporting.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: APO12.02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="ceHBMdHGofH0zuc_rEOh-59" vertex="1">
